      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McCormack Estates are delighted to present No.31 Ennis House, Clare Village to the market For Sale.\r\n\r\nThe property which has been tastefully upgraded and beautifully decorated is presented to the market in excellent condition throughout and is sure to appeal to first time buyers and investors.\r\n\r\nBenefiting from a highly energy efficient B rated BER, 4th floor position, North East views from the bedrooms out towards Ireland's Eye and a South West sunny aspect at the rear balcony with views into the City Centre and of the iconic Poolbeg Chimneys, the orientation is second to none.\r\n\r\nInternally, the apartment comprises of a spacious entrance hallway, storage room, main bathroom, and a kitchen/dining area that flows into a large open-plan living area. The living space provides direct access to the balcony. There are two bedrooms to the rear; notably, the en-suite in one bedroom has been cleverly re-purposed into a walk-in wardrobe, with the option to revert to its original layout.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from secure gated access with underground parking and lifts directly from the underground to the 4th floor. Within the development there are landscaped communal areas and a creche. The Location is excellent being just off the Malahide Road, Clarehall Shopping Centre is adjacent the development and bus routes are plentiful in the area, there are a host of amenities surrounding the property to include shops, sports & leisure facilities, Malahide road industrial park with a fantastic variety of outlets is a short walk away.\r\n\r\nContact McCormack Estates today to register your interest.\r\n\r\n*Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
